# Vivado build artifacts — all regenerated by `make`.
#
# Committed (source of truth):  kr260_hw.tcl, extend_design.tcl, build.tcl,
#                                Makefile, ip/*.v, constraints/cons.xdc
# Ignored (regeneratable):       everything else listed below.

# Full Vivado project (project name = kr260_hw): ~130 MB of cache + runs + IP
kr260_hw/

# Exported hardware handoff — rebuilt by `make`; consumers auto-build it
kr260_hw.xsa

# Build logs (one written by Vivado, one captured from stdout/stderr)
build.log
build.stdout.log
build_*.backup.log

# Vivado runtime junk
.Xil/
*.jou
*.str
vivado_*.backup.log
vivado_*.backup.jou
